<h1 class="display-4">Gamemaster Toolbox</h1>
<p class="lead">
    A private workbench for tabletop gamemasters. Build the random tables you use at the table, chain them
    into flows, and keep your character sheets in one place. Log in to start: everything you make is yours alone.
</p>

<h2 class="display-6">What you can do</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Game systems:</strong> group your oracles, flows and sheets by the game you are running.</li>
    <li><strong>Oracles:</strong> dice tables (d4 to d100, or several dice such as 2d6) and card oracles drawn from a full playing-card deck (no jokers) or a tarot deck.</li>
    <li><strong>Roll and draw:</strong> roll any dice table, or draw from a deck that stays shuffled for your session.</li>
    <li><strong>Flows:</strong> chain oracles, ask questions and branch on the results, so one click runs a whole procedure.</li>
    <li><strong>Sheets:</strong> upload character sheet PDFs and keep every version.</li>
    <li><strong>Import and export:</strong> save your oracles and flows as a JSON file on your computer, and load one back in. Sharing with another gamemaster is just sending them the file.</li>
    <li><strong>Themes:</strong> pick a color theme from the menu at the top right.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="display-6">Your account</h2>
<p>
    Everything you make is tied to your account and nobody else can see it. Log in with a Gamemaster Toolbox
    account, or with your portfolio account. Deleting your account deletes everything in it.
</p>
